{"skill":{"slug":"wan-image-video-generation-editting","displayName":"Wan Image and Video Generation and Editting"},"version":{"version":"1.0.2","createdAt":1773323778378,"changelog":"No user-visible changes in this version.\n\n- No file changes detected.\n- No updates to SKILL.md content except a minor fix: corrected typo in the reference2video options, changing 'character1' to 'character2' for the second file reference.\n- No new features or bug fixes introduced.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":9269,"sha256":"e2b79bb061fc52294ac79779e5f033144820ce52a3afd35c4f2a3449718cd373","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/wan-magic.py","size":19376,"sha256":"e0efe6a584e9708a1fe095c846a2c37545f3b503edbb789c6333e3fbd1ec4fc3","contentType":"text/x-python-script"},{"path":"references/wan2.6-i2v-api-doc.md","size":7589,"sha256":"80e70605f889238a9096383e30c8ac9bbe27808f4a9ad7f56432a06bc7cd1038","contentType":null},{"path":"references/wan2.6-t2i-api-doc.md","size":5473,"sha256":"16f44a96e57e94408af7a87f0e261704c5a6e87dd36a3b2978b3b656141689e6","contentType":null},{"path":"references/wan2.6-r2v-api-doc.md","size":11358,"sha256":"5d97daa52673b2fac40c0554ce8e5fa25987701e5865a0f0b3dacca1ad50fafc","contentType":null},{"path":"references/wan2.6-t2v-api-doc.md","size":7042,"sha256":"62658187851ba4a7ba0a6d5e226737eb4fdcc7768f39e02b34c16e67f1a0c40a","contentType":null},{"path":"references/wan2.6-image-api-doc.md","size":6716,"sha256":"fb1ae58c59cb14e4c557df0943b2afe8d5f28be8369a56ae113f8ea53d62e97c","contentType":null},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2879,"sha256":"013bd40a128e1397773d036722547bd5e5b00e8add286d852945cb3b8fbef23d","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789093643305,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"21d0d52aaf5ff02aeda1f9346f3cfb5435935497cb0821da368b970ebc5315b4","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/21d0d52aaf5ff02aeda1f9346f3cfb5435935497cb0821da368b970ebc5315b4","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: wan-image-video-generation-editting\nVersion: 1.0.2\n\nThe skill bundle provides a legitimate integration for Alibaba's Wan image and video generation models via the DashScope API. The primary script, `scripts/wan-magic.py`, implements standard wrappers for text-to-image, image editing, and video generation tasks, communicating exclusively with the official `dashscope.aliyuncs.com` endpoint. While the script includes functionality to read and base64-encode local files, this behavior is explicitly documented and required for the stated purpose of processing local images; no evidence of intentional data exfiltration, malicious execution, or harmful prompt injection was found.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779168242320},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":100,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":30,"checkedAt":1789093643305},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Alibaba DashScope media-generation helper; it sends user prompts and selected media to the Wan API but shows no hidden persistence, destructive behavior, or unrelated data access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Use of python3, the DASHSCOPE_API_KEY environment variable, and outbound requests to DashScope is proportionate to the API-integration purpose, but users should understand that prompts and selected images leave the machine.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact contains markdown references and one Python script; no install hook, dependency installer, startup task, or remote code retrieval was found.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill documents Python commands and required inputs, including that local images are converted to base64 and passed to the model API; it would be clearer with a stronger privacy warning before local media upload.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No background workers, scheduled tasks, persistent memory writes, privilege escalation, file deletion, or broad local file indexing were found; local file reads are limited to paths supplied as image inputs.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is image/video generation and editing with Wan models, and the script implements matching text-to-image, image-edit, text-to-video, image-to-video, reference-to-video, and task polling commands.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable sending prompts, referenced URLs, and any explicitly provided local image files to Alibaba DashScope using your DASHSCOPE_API_KEY. Do not use private or confidential media unless your policy permits that upload.","findings":"[TT3] expected: The environment-derived API key is used as a Bearer authorization header for DashScope API calls, which is normal authentication for this service rather than evidence of credential exfiltration.\n[LP3] expected: The skill front matter declares python3 and DASHSCOPE_API_KEY requirements, though it does not declare a host-level network allowlist; this is a containment documentation gap, not a purpose mismatch.\n[SQP-2] expected: The skill discloses that local images are base64 encoded and passed to the model API, but the disclosure is understated; users should avoid sensitive media unless they intend to upload it to Alibaba DashScope.\n[E1] expected: External HTTP transmission is the core mechanism of this API wrapper and targets documented DashScope endpoints; no unrelated destination or hidden payload was found.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789093643305}}}}}